@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5187
@receiptToken = replace-with-a-booking-receipt-token
@bookingId = 1

### Create or reuse a Stripe test Checkout session (requires STRIPE_TEST_MODE=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/public/payments/{{receiptToken}}/checkout
Accept: application/json

### Download the token-protected booking confirmation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/receipts/{{receiptToken}}/confirmation.pdf

### Download the token-protected payment receipt after verified payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/receipts/{{receiptToken}}/reservation.pdf

### Obtain an admin antiforgery token and cookie before recording cash
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/csrf

### Record the remaining cash balance at the shop (requires an authenticated admin/staff cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/payments/{{bookingId}}/cash
X-CSRF-TOKEN: replace-with-request-token

### Download a cash receipt (requires an authenticated admin/staff cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/receipts/{{bookingId}}/cash.pdf

### Stripe webhook example only: replace payload and signature with a Stripe-signed test event
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/stripe/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
Stripe-Signature: t=replace-with-unix-timestamp,v1=replace-with-hmac-sha256-signature

{}
